#====================================================================
# DRAFT-pico-sdk-empty-submodules-scope — Debian orig tarball 保留空 submodule 目录时的范围裁剪
# Source event: pico-sdk 2.2.0 HarmonyOS adaptation, shadow CI PASS on 2026-08-25
#====================================================================

id:                     E425
trigger_tool:           conan|source|package
phase:                  source|dependency-analysis|package
error_signature:        tinyusb|cyw43-driver|lwip|mbedtls|btstack|\.gitmodules|empty submodule|No such file or directory.*lib/tinyusb
severity:               2
category:               dependency, embedded-sdk, source-scope
match_keywords:         pico-sdk, .gitmodules, empty submodule, tinyusb, cyw43-driver, lwip, mbedtls, btstack, Debian orig tarball, dependency split
title:                  pico-sdk Debian orig tarball 的外部 submodule 可保持空目录，但需明确限定当前包功能范围

root_cause:             pico-sdk 2.2.0 的 Debian orig tarball 保留 lib/tinyusb、lib/cyw43-driver、lib/lwip、lib/mbedtls、lib/btstack 等 submodule 目录但内容为空。pioasm 子项目不依赖这些目录；完整 SDK USB/Wi-Fi/network/Bluetooth 功能才需要它们。
affected_scope:         使用发行版 orig tarball 或非 recursive archive 包装含 submodule 的嵌入式 SDK 项目。
verification_cmd:       test -f archives/p/pico-sdk/2.2.0/conanfile.py && conan graph info archives/p/pico-sdk/2.2.0 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           scope-current-package-and-preserve-placeholders
rec_description:        当前 PR 明确只提供 pioasm + SDK source tree，打包时创建空 submodule 占位目录以保持路径形状；不下载、不 vendoring、不把外部 submodule 适配混入本库 PR。
rec_command:            mkdir -p share/pico-sdk/lib/{tinyusb,cyw43-driver,lwip,mbedtls,btstack}
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               conan-package-scope

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      split-submodule-dependencies
fallback_description:   若 test_package 或 downstream 需要真实 submodule 内容，先拆 tinyusb/cyw43-driver/lwip/mbedtls/btstack 为独立库适配并发布，再在 pico-sdk 后续版本/功能 PR 中依赖它们。
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          dependency-prs

forbid_1_pattern:       git submodule update|FetchContent.*tinyusb|curl.*github.com/hathach/tinyusb|copy.*third_party.*mbedtls
forbid_1_reason:        当前一库一 PR 范围是 pico-sdk；把 submodule 拉入 recipe 会把多个依赖库适配混在一起。
forbid_1_consequence:   PR 范围失控，依赖发布顺序不清，后续制品不可复现。

principles:             P016
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             []
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

doc_file:               knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-pico-sdk-empty-submodules-scope.md
last_updated:           2026-08-25
source_event:           pico-sdk 2.2.0 source analysis: Debian orig tarball has empty external submodule directories
authors: wxjshr <wxjshr@noreply.gitcode.com>
